      "title": "Silvia Federici: Why You Have to Support No More 24",
      "description": "During the International Workshops we co-hosted with the NYC Anarchist Book Fair, Silvia Federici spoke about the No More 24 campaign and invited us to show up in NYC on October 3rd to demand Speaker Menin stop 24-hour workdays. The No More 24 Act, Intro 303, would replace 24-hour home care shifts with two 12-hour shifts. It has been stalled for four years, and the U.N. says the delay violates human rights law. RSVP for the rally: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdMGnOtAGnbZTbdEWvuh9Z64Qnjv4QzleslhFGl_GXI9r5y1w/viewform Campaign: https://nomore24.org #NoMore24 #SilviaFederici #Shorts",
